  "notes": "Image shows top and bottom views of the same board. Edge headers transcribed once from the top view (the bottom view shows the same holes mirrored with silkscreen only). Bottom-view pad columns named by the bottom-view orientation; callout lines cross but match the printed pad numbers. Category-only tags (UART, PWM, I2S, ADC, I2C, SPI) omitted. B+/B- battery pads, BOOST jumper, BOOT/RESET buttons, LED and BATTERY LED skipped. Chinese note about the BOOST charge-current jumper not transcribed."
